    {
      "text": "Cast equiatomic HfNbTaTiZr has a yield strength of 163–530 MPa at 1000 °C at strain rates of 10^−4–10^−2 s^−1.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "HfNbTaTiZr has inadequate oxidation resistance for high-temperature use in air.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514121::web::020::5_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pre-oxidation at approximately 1000 °C in air for about 30 minutes will form a protective oxide scale on cast HfNbTaTiZr.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-oxidation scale will be dense, adherent, and nanostructured.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-oxidation scale will be composed primarily of HfO2 and TaO2.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The mixed oxide scale will act as a barrier to oxygen diffusion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxygen-diffusion barrier will suppress further high-temperature oxidation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Suppressing oxygen ingress will minimize oxygen-induced embrittlement.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10453588::web::017::4_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-oxidation treatment will preserve the cast alloy's microstructure and intrinsic mechanical properties.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pre-oxidized HfNbTaTiZr will have a lower oxidation rate and slower scale degradation than untreated cast HfNbTaTiZr.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pre-oxidized HfNbTaTiZr will retain the untreated alloy's room-temperature ductility.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pre-oxidized HfNbTaTiZr will retain the untreated alloy's high-temperature yield strength.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "High-temperature oxidation can reduce tensile plasticity.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
