        "PMC10453588::web::017::4_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention is expected to remain effective during static or moderately dynamic loading at about 1000 °C and strain rates of 10^−4–10^−2 s^−1 for relatively short exposures.",
